(comment RubberTree "Individual rubber trees - trees of the species Hevea braziliensis; their milky sap is harvested and used as natural rubber.")
(comment WelshPerson "This is the collection of people who are #$citizens of #$Wales, or participate in its #$NationalCulture.")
(comment Clip-Fastener "The collection of clips.

This includes paper clips but also the larger varieties of clips

intended for holding together thicker stacks of paper.")
(comment CompressedGasTank "A container of high pressure gas.")
