(comment HandleBar "Handlebar like on a bicycle, motorcycle or snowmobile.  The rider steers the device using the handlebars")
(comment KaithiCharacter "characters composed of major sections for consonants and added squiggles for vowels other than A, this script is actually the one employed by the Kayaths-- the writing caste-- throughout northern India")
