(comment DorsalRamusC3 "The collection of all C3 dorsal rami.  #$VentralRamusC3 and #$DorsalRamusC3 branch from SpinalRootC3.  #$DorsalRamusC3 supplies the #$ThirdOccipitalNerve.")
(comment ProductionAmountInEventFn "(#$ProductionAmountInEventFn EVENT OBJECT-TYPE) denotes the number of instances of OBJECT-TYPE produced in EVENT.")
(comment SearchEngine "A collection of computer programs. Each #$SearchEngine takes as input a query string (which may be natural language, a specified syntax, or just a series of words) and returns a list of 'hits' - pointers to documents the search engine believes are relevant to the query. The domain for a search engine may be the World Wide Web, Usenet newsgroups, an individual #$ComputerDisk, or any other online collection of documents.")
(comment Cable "Heavy, multi-strand line made of rope or metal strands twisted together to form a very strong line.")
(comment Gene-HUType "A collection of collection.  Each instance of #$Gene-HUType is an identified type of gene.  Each instance of #$Gene-HUType is a spec of #$Gene-HereditaryUnit, but not every spec of the later is an instance of the former.  This collection enables the description of genes as type-collections, and eventually will provide a hook from Cyc KB to any external database of genes.")
(comment BumperSticker "Collection of stickers that are displayed, typically, on automobile bumpers.")
(comment TokelauIslandsPerson "This is the collection of people who are #$citizens of #$TokelauIslands, or participate in its #$NationalCulture.")
