(comment InfectingByContact "A collection of events. Instances of #$InfectingByContact are infecting occuring as contact with pathogen.")
(comment InfectingByIngestion "A collection of events. Instances of #$InfectingByIngestion are infecting occuring as ingestion of pathogens.")
