(comment ConveyingMaterials "Moving some kind of material from one point to another, where the goal is to transport the goods. Different from just mixing stuff or putting stuff with other stuff. We remain agnostic as to whether in instances of this collection the #$conveyor-Generic remains stationary (transport through a #$Pipeline) or moves along with the #$transportees (transport in a #$Truck).")
