(comment CollectionValueChangingFn "An instance of #$CollectionDenotingFunction useful for indicating when the  collection that stands in arg2 of some instance of #$BinaryPredicate changes for some thing.  (#$CollectionValueChangingFn BIN_PRED THING COLL-VAL1 COLL-VAL2) denotes the collection of events in which the value for the instance of #$BinaryAttributePredicate ATT_PRED for THING changes from COLL-VAL1 to COLL-VAL2.  For instance, (#$CollectionValueChangingFn #$educationLevel Bob #$FirstGradeLevel #$SecondGradeLevel) denotes the collection of events in which Bob goes from having a first grade education level to the second grade education level.  This function is a collection form of #$SlotValueChangingFn, after which it is patterned.")
