(comment FormalProductFn "(#$FormalProductFn PRODUCT_TYPE) is a disjoint collection of collections.  Each element of this collection is a distinct #$FormalProductType and a subcollection of PRODUCT_TYPE.")
(comment ProductLabel "The collection of information bearing objects which accompany and identify a product.  The label is usually attached to the product or to the product's packaging.  The label usually carried the name and/or logo of the product's maker.  If the product is a food item, the label will list the product's ingredients.")
(comment PackagingContainerProduct "Container product intended to serve as the packaging for other products.  ")
