(comment Jersey-TheShirt "Jerseys are shirts worn in organized sporting events.  A jersey has some kind of identification information like a number or name on it.  Team members wear similar jerseys.")
(comment MakingAvailableFn "This function can be used to denote the set of events in which an agent makes it possible for another agent to use (but not own) a good or service.")
