(comment Toy "An instance of #$ArtifactByGenericType and a specialization of #$PhysicalDevice.  Each instance of #$Toy is a #$PortableObject whose primary function [#$primaryFunction] is to be played with by, and provide amusement to, children or #$DomesticPets.")
(comment SecretionEvent "A specialization of both #$EmittingStuff and #$BiologicalProductionEvent.  Each instance of #$SecretionEvent is an event in which a living animal or plant secretes from its body some instance of #$Secretion-Bodily (q.v.).")
(comment insIdenticalWRT "(#$insIdenticalWRT COL THING) means that all instances of COL are identical with respect to THING.")
(disjointWith Bicycle Unicycle)
(disjointWith Bicycle Tricycle)
(disjointWith Unicycle Tricycle)
(disjointWith Shoe StorageConstruct)
(disjointWith Organization Mixture)
