(comment Artifact-NonAgentive "An instance of #$ObjectType, and a specialization of #$Artifact-Generic.  #$Artifact-NonAgentive is the collection of all artifacts that are _not_ agents (i.e., that are _not_ instances of #$Agent-Generic).  Specializations of #$Artifact-NonAgentive include #$Bicycle, #$Pants, #$Canal, and #$FoodUtensil.")
