(disjointWith MastersLevel CollegeSeniorLevel)
(comment CollegeSeniorLevel "college senior level")
(comment UsedCarLoan "A #$LoanAgreement is a #$UsedCarLoan (#$loanDedication LOAN #$UsedCarLoan) just when it is a loan for the purpose of buying a previously owned automobile for personal use.  The funds borrowed are supposed to be used solely for this purpose.  Such a loan is secured by the automobile purchased.")
(comment MusicalComposition-Swing "The Collection of instances of #$MusicalComposition that are in the swing style or genre.")
(disjointWith TurningOffPoweredDevice (ObtainingDeviceStateFn ElectricalHouseholdAppliance DeviceState-Rinsing))
(comment Uneven "An attribute for describing surfaces which are uneven, not flat.")
(comment SimilarPhysicalObjectsAnthropacity "(#$mtAnthropacity MT #$SimilarPhysicalObjectsAnthropacity) means that MT assumes the existence of a physical universe like ours, with the same sorts of naturally-occurring non-living objects (stars, planets, chemicals, minerals, etc.).")
(disjointWith LitBrightEnoughForSeeing LitAtVeryBrightLightIntensity)
(disjointWith LitAtIndoorIlluminationLevel LitAtVeryBrightLightIntensity)
(comment StandingOnTipToesPosture "The subcollection of #$Animal whose instances are in the posture of standing on the tips of their toes.")
(comment HomeImprovementLoan "A #$LoanAgreement is a #$HomeImprovementLoan (#$loanDedication LOAN #$HomeImprovementLoan) just when it is a loan of money that is supposed to be used for improvements on the home of the #$borrower.  Such a loan is made only to homeowners whose homes or whose home equities are used as collateral for the loan.")
(disjointWith HexaploidOrganism TetraploidOrganism)
(disjointWith TriploidOrganism TetraploidOrganism)
(comment MusicalComposition-Song "The collection of instances of #$MusicalComposition that are \"song-like\" in nature.  They usually have 
lyrics and are relatively short in duration.  An example of an instance of this collection is \"Let it be\" by #$TheBeatles-MusicGroup.  Negative examples might
be the 2nd movement of some classical symphony.")
(comment StackArchitecture "The attribute which indicates that the computer's architecture is stack oriented.")
(disjointWith Powder Water)
(comment WhiteColor "The color white.")
(comment General-Rank "Highest conventional rank for a commissioned officer in the

U.S. Army and in the U.S. Marine Corps.  (This is the specific rank of full 'General' and not the generic term that would include #$BrigadierGeneral-Rank, #$MajorGeneral-Rank or #$LieutenantGeneral-Rank.)  In the U.S. Army, a full General typically commands an instance of #$Army-UnitDesignation.")
(comment MusicalComposition-HardRock "The Collection of instances of #$MusicalComposition that are in the hard rock style or genre.")
(comment TrueTypeFont "A particular type of font under MSWindows which can be scaled to any size")
(disjointWith Granular Liquid-StateOfMatter)
(disjointWith Granular Suspension)
(disjointWith CellularTangibleThing Granular)
(disjointWith Granular SomethingToWear)
(comment TickingState "When a timer is in this state, it will finish (maybe activate the device it's a part of) when the time is up. ")
(disjointWith Slope-VeryLowGradient Slope-FlatGradient)
(disjointWith RoofCoverage-Negligible RoofCoverage-Sparse)
(disjointWith RoofCoverage-Moderate RoofCoverage-Sparse)
(comment MusicalComposition-FolkRock "The Collection of instances of #$MusicalComposition that are in the folk rock style or genre.")
(comment ComputerGameProgram-Baseball "The collection of instances of #$ComputerGameProgram which simulate baseball.")
(comment MusicalComposition-ACappella "The Collection of instances of #$MusicalComposition that are designed to be performed with voice alone without musical accompaniment.")
(comment NickelColor "The color nickel")
(comment BiometricallyProtected "A specialization of #$AuthenticationProtected, #$BiometricallyProtected is the instance of IndividualTypeBySecurityStatus that applies to individuals which, to access, one must participate in an instance of #$BiometricAuthenticationEvent.")
(comment StaffSergeant-Rank "Rank intermediate between #$Sergeant-Rank and 
  #$GunnerySergeant-Rank in the #$UnitedStatesMarineCorps.")
(comment PropositionalConceptualWork-BiographyGenre "The collection of instances of #$PropositionalConceptualWork that are of the 
biography genre.  Works in this genre usually detail the life of some famous or significant 
person.        ")
(disjointWith HighPlasticitySoilRegion LowPlasticitySoilRegion)
(comment ConversationFailing-TimeViolation "A conversation takes on this attribute if there is a time violation.")
(comment PhysicallyRestricted "The attribute describing the security level of objects protected by some kind of physical restriction or barrier, such as a wall or an electric fence.  Distinct from #$AlarmProtected in that #$PhysicallyRestricted objects have something which physically inhibits someone without legal access from reaching it, while an alarm merely sounds a warning.")
(comment OxyphobicBLO "Oxyphobic tissues or organisms are those that cannot live in the presence of oxygen")
(comment PropositionalConceptualWork-SportsGenre "The collection of instances of #$PropositionalConceptualWork that are of the
sports genre.  Sports and sporting events are prominently featured in works of this genre.
<p>")
(comment ComputerGameProgram-ChildrensGame "The collection of instances of #$ComputerGameProgram which are designed for children.")
(disjointWith PartDirectPartIndirect IndeterminateIllumination)
(disjointWith DirectIllumination IndeterminateIllumination)
