(disjointWith Brittle Flexible)
(disjointWith Flexible RealEstate)
(comment FleshBlackColor "The color fleshBlack")
(comment PureGrayColor "Pure gray -- A color void of any hue or chroma.  Shades of this color differ from shades of #$GrayColor in that all shades of #$PureGrayColor lack both hue and chroma, while some shades of #$GrayColor do have hue and chroma.")
(comment MajorGeneral-Rank "Rank intermediate between #$BrigadierGeneral-Rank and

