(comment SaleItemsInStock "The items sold are in stock")
(comment ModernMinimalistArchitecturalStyle "The #$ModernMinimalistArchitecturalStyle is a plain style of building design that became popular in the early to mid 20th Century.  It is characterized by plain straight lines and planes, and only simple geometric ornament (as opposed to neoclassic or gothic), if any. 'Modernity' through severe simplicity of geometric appearance was sought.  Almost every commercial and government building in the mid to late 20th Century was in this style.  It began to be partially supplanted by the #$PostmodernArchitecturalStyle before the turn of the millennium.")
(comment Petite "An attribute appropriate for clothing specifically sized for petite (short) women.")
(comment Hereditary-Ailment "The collection of animals with hereditary ailment conditions.  \"hereditary\" characterizes an ailment which is the result of the transmission of genetic characteristics from parent to offspring.")
(comment Libra-TheSign "The collection of people associated with the seventh sign of the zodiac. Named after the #$Constellation Libra, or The Scales. Ruled by the #$PlanetVenus. #$Persons born between September 23 and October 22 have this sign.")
(comment Libra-TheSign "The seventh sign of the zodiac. Named after the #$Constellation Libra, or The Scales. Ruled by the #$PlanetVenus. #$Persons born between September 23 and October 22 have this sign.")
