proposition (see #$goalSituationSuccessIf) for GOAL-SIT is true or is

inferrable.  More precisely it means that GOAL-SITUATION is active or

important or relevant to the current state of affairs (see

#$GoalSuccessAndFailureNotApplicable) AND it means that there is a

binding for PROP (#$goalSituationSuccessIf GOAL-SITUATION PROP).")
