particular #$AilmentCondition.  This is an unusual attribute, as one cannot simply be
'vaccinated' or 'unvaccinated'.  Rather, one must be vaccinated AGAINST
something--more specifically, a particular disease or virus.  The
salient assertion below makes this clear.")
