(comment Colonel-Rank "Rank intermediate between #$LieutenantColonel-Rank and #$BrigadierGeneral-Rank in the U.S. Army and in the U.S. Marine Corps.  In the U.S. Army, a Colonel may be in command of several instances of #$Battalion-UnitDesignation.")
