(comment RealTimeProgram "A program which responds to inputs during execution OR generates intermediate outputs.  Thus a chaotic flow simulation running on a CM is real-time, even though it accepts no inputs during execution, and even though the simulation may take many orders of magnitude longer than the real flow would.  The opposite of batch.")
(comment Burnt "Something which is #$Burnt has not yet been destroyed.  However a portion of it has been destroyed in a #$CombustionProcess.  Note that this is not a #$genls for #$SkinBurn, because most skin burns do not actually involve combustion.  Third-degree burns would be both #$SkinBurn and #$Burnt.")
